\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=\&quot;bold-sans-serif\&quot;&gt;H&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt;, and the reconstructed &lt;inline-formula xmlns:ifp=\&quot;http://www.ifactory.com/press\&quot; id=\&quot;IE48\&quot;&gt;&lt;math id=\&quot;IM48\&quot; display=\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;S&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;ξ&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt; matrix, respectively. (b) BIC scores for GMM using different &lt;i&gt;n&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;cluster&lt;\/sub&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/caption&gt;&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;&lt;caption encoding-type=\&quot;nlm\&quot; ifp-element-xpath=\&quot;/*[local-name() = 'figure' and namespace-uri() = 'http://www.ifactory.com/press']/*[local-name() = 'caption' and namespace-uri() = 'http://www.ifactory.com/press']\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(a) NMF process for the normalized &lt;inline-formula xmlns:ifp=\&quot;http://www.ifactory.com/press\&quot; id=\&quot;IE44\&quot;&gt;&lt;math id=\&quot;IM44\&quot; display=\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;S&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;ξ&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt; matrix, with &lt;i&gt;n&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;comp&lt;\/sub&gt; set to 2. (from left to right) The normalized &lt;inline-formula xmlns:ifp=\&quot;http://www.ifactory.com/press\&quot; id=\&quot;IE45\&quot;&gt;&lt;math id=\&quot;IM45\&quot; display=\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;S&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;ξ&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt; matrix, the feature matrix &lt;inline-formula xmlns:ifp=\&quot;http://www.ifactory.com/press\&quot; id=\&quot;IE46\&quot;&gt;&lt;math id=\&quot;IM46\&quot; display=\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=\&quot;bold-sans-serif\&quot;&gt;W&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt;, the coefficient matrix &lt;inline-formula xmlns:ifp=\&quot;http://www.ifactory.com/press\&quot; id=\&quot;IE47\&quot;&gt;&lt;math id=\&quot;IM47\&quot; display=\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=\&quot;bold-sans-serif\&quot;&gt;H&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt;, and the reconstructed &lt;inline-formula xmlns:ifp=\&quot;http://www.ifactory.com/press\&quot; id=\&quot;IE48\&quot;&gt;&lt;math id=\&quot;IM48\&quot; display=\&quot;inline\&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;S&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;ξ&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;z&lt;\/mi&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/msub&gt;&lt;\/mrow&gt;&lt;\/math&gt;&lt;\/inline-formula&gt; matrix, respectively. (b) BIC scores for GMM using different &lt;i&gt;n&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;cluster&lt;\/sub&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/caption&gt;&quot;,&quot;watermarkPath&quot;:&quot;AMS-Logo-Lockup-Journals-01.png&quot;,&quot;currentUri&quot;:&quot;/journals/phoc/55/6/JPO-D-24-0098.1.xml&quot;}]}" aria-selected="false" role="option" data-menu-item="list-id-00266a14-e874-48f6-a03a-7ccb1bf290d7" class="ListItem ListItem--disableGutters ListItem--divider">
