                                           <figcaption><b><sc>Fig</sc>. 3.</b></figcaption>
                                       
                                       
                                               <figcaption>
<p>(a) NMF process for the normalized <inline-formula id="IE44" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM44"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM44"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></script></inline-formula> matrix, with <i>n</i><sub>comp</sub> set to 2. (from left to right) The normalized <inline-formula id="IE45" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM45"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM45"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></script></inline-formula> matrix, the feature matrix <inline-formula id="IE46" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM46"><mi mathvariant="bold-sans-serif">W</mi></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM46"><mi mathvariant="bold-sans-serif">W</mi></math></script></inline-formula>, the coefficient matrix <inline-formula id="IE47" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM47"><mi mathvariant="bold-sans-serif">H</mi></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM47"><mi mathvariant="bold-sans-serif">H</mi></math></script></inline-formula>, and the reconstructed <inline-formula id="IE48" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM48"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM48"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></script></inline-formula> matrix, respectively. (b) BIC scores for GMM using different <i>n</i><sub>cluster</sub>.</p></figcaption>
                                           
