<p>Relationship between <i>R<sub>ω</sub></i> and <i>q<sub>ξ</sub></i>. (a),(b) Ridgeline plots of <i>R<sub>ω</sub></i> and <i>q<sub>ξ</sub></i> for different clusters, respectively. (c) Scatterplot of <i>R<sub>ω</sub></i> against <i>q<sub>ξ</sub></i> (color dots), with black squares representing bin-averaged results and a black line representing the fitted result.</p>
                            
                        </span>


