<p>Temporal variations of daily and domain-averaged (a) 〈<i>E</i><sub>D2</sub>〉, (b) 〈<i>E</i><sub>D1</sub>〉, (c) 〈<i>E</i><sub>NIW</sub>〉, and (d) <i>r<sub>E</sub></i> for regions A–D. All results are obtained at a height of approximately 500 m above the ocean bottom.</p>
                            
                        </span>


