</button><pf-box data-xsl-identifier="figure-popover" class="figure-popover display-none"><div class="display-table m-auto"><div class="image-wrapper flex flex-col flex-align-start"><img data-image-src="/view/journals/phoc/55/6/full-JPO-D-24-0098.1-f1.jpg" src="/skin/710ad8a6b2413221890b4b07720ada0d29d8e951/img/Blank.svg" class="lazy-load" alt="Fig. 1."></div></div></pf-box></div></div><div class="figure-text-wrapper pl-3"><figcaption><span style="font-variant: small-caps;">Fig</span>. 1.</figcaption>
