        <ul class="c-List c-List-dense"><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e271" class="c-Button--link">Abstract</a><ul class="c-List c-List--nested"><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e314" class="c-Button--link">Significance Statement</a></li></ul></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e401" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">1. </span>Introduction</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e614" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">2. </span>Data and methods</a><ul class="c-List c-List--nested"><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e618" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">a. </span>In situ observations</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e645" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">b. </span>Model simulation</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e744" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">c. </span>IW spectra calculation</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e1657" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">d. </span>Fitting of the IW spectra using the GM model</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e1926" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">e. </span>Cluster analysis of the IW spectra</a></li></ul></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e2311" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">3. </span>Distribution of IW spectral features</a><ul class="c-List c-List--nested"><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e2315" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">a. </span>IW spectral level</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e2738" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">b. </span>IW spectral shape</a></li></ul></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e3223" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">4. </span>Discussion on strong NIWs in the deep SCS</a><ul class="c-List c-List--nested"><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e3310" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">a. </span>Spatial and temporal properties</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e3632" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">b. </span>Potential mechanism</a></li></ul></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e4280" class="c-Button--link"><span class="enumeration c-ListItem_text c-ListItem_text-nested c-ListItem_text-dense">5. </span>Summary and discussion</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e4483" class="c-Button--link">Acknowledgments.</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e4488" class="c-Button--link">Data availability statement.</a></li><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--nested"><a href="#d1576052e4501" class="c-Button--link">APPENDIX</a><ul class="c-List c-List--nested"><li class="c-List__item c-List__item--