<p>Three-dimensional structures of (a) <inline-formula id="IE57" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM57"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM57"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></math></script></inline-formula> (shear variance), (b) <inline-formula id="IE58" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><span class="MathJax_Preview"><math display="inline" id="IM58"><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></math></span><script type="math/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM58"><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></math></script></inline-formula> (strain variance), and (c) <i>R<sub>ω</sub></i> (shear-to-strain ratio). (d) Histogram of <i>R<sub>ω</sub></i>. The Luzon Strait and the central SCS are marked by black and purple boxes, respectively.</p></figcaption>
                                           
