th/mml"><math display="inline" id="IM48"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></math></script></inline-formula> matrix, respectively. (b) BIC scores for GMM using different <i>n</i><sub>cluster</sub>.</p>
                            
